// template: Velvet Rooftop
// order: 1
// Amapiano, the jazz side: a tuned log drum that knocks on every hit (a per-note filter
// envelope) and walks the roots between the kicks, a swung shaker that carries the 16ths,
// a recorded open hat, muted congas, bongos and woodblocks in the gaps,
// piano stabs over an eight-bar progression that turns around through ii-V, a breathy
// flute answered by a horn, marimba bursts from a random arpeggio, a log drum solo before
// the drop and a snare roll that climbs in triplets. Style reference only; every melody
// is original.
title "Velvet Rooftop"
tempo 113
key f minor
kick:    kick       deep     x... x... x... x...                                   | decay 0.3 | pitch 58 | sweep 1.5 | click 0.05 | overtone 0.6 | gain 1
log:     fm-bass    pluck    . . . f2 . . f2 . . . . c2 . . eb2 . / . . . bb1 . . bb1 . . . db2 . bb1 . . . / . . . eb2 . . eb2 . . . . bb1 . . db2 . / . . . ab1 . . ab1 . ab1 . c2 . eb2 . c2 . / . . . db2 . . db2 . . . . ab1 . . c2 . / . . . bb1 . . bb1 . . . db2 . f2 . . . / . . . g1 . . g1 . . . bb1 . . . db2 . / . . . c2 . . c2 . [c2 c2] . bb1 . [g1 g1] . c2 c2!   | decay 0.6 | release 0.3 | feedback 0.3 | brightness env(0.09) 0.95..0.3 | distort 0.3 | duck 0.3 | gain 0.9
shaker:  shaker     soft     x x X x x x X x x x X x x x X x?0.5                   | swing 0.14 | velocity 0.55 | pan sine(2) -0.25..0.25 | gain 0.7
ohat:    hat        open     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x?0.7.                                | open 0.55 | decay 0.12 | swing 0.14 | pan 0.2 | gain 0.5
clap:    clap       snap     .... x... .... x...                                   | decay 0.25 | reverb plate | gain 0.9
tok:     woodblock  high     . . x . . x . . . . x . . x . . / . . x . . x . . . x . . x . x?0.5 .   | swing 0.14 | pan -0.4 | delay 3/16 | gain 0.5
knock:   woodblock  low      x . . . . . . x . . . . . . . . / x . . . . . . x . . x . . . . .   | swing 0.14 | pan 0.3 | reverb room | gain 0.5
bongo:   bongo      low      . . . x . . . . . . . x . . . . / . . . x . . . . . x . . . x?0.6 . .   | swing 0.14 | pan 0.45 | gain 0.5
conga:   conga      muted    . . x . . . x . . . x . x . . . / . . x . . . x . . x . . . x?0.6 . .   | swing 0.14 | pan -0.35 | reverb room | gain 0.45
tom:     tom        electronic .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... .... ..x. x.xx   | tune 0.45 | reverb plate | pan -0.2 | gain 0.55
roll:    snare      snap     x... x... x... x... / x... x... x... x... / x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. / x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. / [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] / xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx / [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] [x x x] / x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2 x*2   | tune saw(8) 0.3..0.85 | highpass saw(8) 150..900 | gain saw(8) 0.1..0.55 | reverb plate
keys:    piano      bright   Fm9! . . Fm9 . . Fm9 . . . Fm9 . . . . . / . . Bbm9 . . Bbm9 . . Bbm9! . . Bbm9 . Bbm9 . . / Eb7sus4! . . Eb7sus4 . . Eb7sus4 . . . Eb7sus4 . . . . . / . . Abmaj9 . . Abmaj9 . . Abmaj9! . . Abmaj9 . Abmaj9 . . / Dbmaj9! . . Dbmaj9 . . Dbmaj9 . . . Dbmaj9 . . . . . / . . Bbm9 . . Bbm9 . . Bbm9! . . Bbm9 . Bbm9 . . / Gm7b5! . . Gm7b5 . . Gm7b5 . . . Gm7b5 . . . . . / . . C7sus4 . . C7sus4 . . C7sus4! . . C7sus4 . C7sus4 . .   | voicing drop2 | velocity 0.6 | swing 0.1 | eq-low -6 | chorus 0.2 | reverb room | gain 0.5
pad:     pad        dark     Fm9 ~ ~ ~ / Bbm9 ~ ~ ~ / Eb7sus4 ~ ~ ~ / Abmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Dbmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Bbm9 ~ ~ ~ / Gm7b5 ~ ~ ~ / C7sus4 ~ ~ ~   | voicing spread | attack 0.8 | release 2 | lowpass sine(16) 900..2600 | duck 0.5 | reverb hall | gain 0.3
mallet:  mallet     wood     . Fm9 ~ . . . Fm9 . / . Bbm9 ~ . . . . . / . Eb7sus4 ~ . . . Eb7sus4 . / . Abmaj9 ~ . . . . . / . Dbmaj9 ~ . . . Dbmaj9 . / . Bbm9 ~ . . . . . / . Gm7b5 ~ . . . Gm7b5 . / . C7sus4 ~ . . . . .   | arp random | arp-rate 1/16 | arp-octaves 2 | transpose 12 | velocity 0.55 | delay 3/16 | pan 0.35 | gain 0.4
flute:   fm-lead    flute    c5 ~ ~ [eb5 f5] ab5 ~ f5 ~ / eb5 ~ db5 ~ c5 ~ . . / bb4 ~ ~ ab4 bb4 ~ db5 ~ / c5 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . . / f5 ~ ab5 ~ [g5 ab5] g5 f5 ~ / eb5 ~ ~ f5 db5 ~ c5 ~ / bb4 ~ db5 ~ f5 ~ eb5 db5 / c5 ~ ~ ~ bb4 ~ g4 ~   | legato | glide 0.06 | attack 0.06 | release 0.5 | delay 1/4 | reverb hall | pan -0.15 | gain 0.3
horn:    brass      horn     . . . . . . . . / . . . . . . f4 ab4 / ab4 ~ . . . . . . / . . . . . . eb5 ~ / db5 ~ . . . . . . / . . . . . . . . / . . . . . . . . / . . . . . . . .   | reverb room | delay 3/16 | pan 0.25 | gain 0.4
vox:     vox        aah      f4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ / . . . . . . . . / ab4 ~ ~ ~ eb4 ~ ~ ~ / . . . . . . . . / f4 ~ ~ ~ ab4 ~ ~ ~ / . . . . . . . . / f4 ~ ~ ~ db4 ~ ~ ~ / . . . . c4 ~ ~ ~   | attack 0.12 | release 0.8 | delay 1/4 | reverb hall | gain 0.5
riser:   riser      tone     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 16.5 | gain 0.45
sweep:   sweep      down     x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb hall | gain 0.4
wind:    noise      wind     x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff sine(8) 500..1600 | reverb hall | pan sine(4) -0.4..0.4 | gain 0.25
section intro   shaker tok knock bongo pad wind
section groove  kick log shaker ohat clap tok knock bongo conga tom keys | loop
section verse   kick log shaker ohat clap tok knock bongo conga tom keys pad mallet horn
section solo    log shaker clap tok knock
section build   shaker keys pad roll riser
section drop    kick log shaker ohat clap tok knock bongo conga tom keys pad flute horn vox
section break   pad keys flute vox wind sweep
section build2  shaker keys pad mallet roll riser
section drop2   kick log shaker ohat clap tok knock bongo conga tom keys pad mallet flute horn vox
section outro   kick shaker ohat tok knock bongo conga
song intro 16, groove 16, verse 16, solo 8, build 8, drop 32, break 16, build2 8, drop2 32, solo 8, outro 16
